From 69b169198631f21162b6637675b35b52aeb6eecd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yi Xie <imxieyi@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 17:09:33 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 07/15] venus: consume paired protocol headers from an explicit
 build directory

---
